46187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "234635637", "author": {"steamid": "76561198401588700", "personaname": "philip", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198401588700/", "num_games_owned": 198, "num_reviews": 151, "playtime_forever": 2209, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2209, "last_played": 1788288676, "avatar": "4cb83a2f4ac2ec98eef4e55cd6e96bd208861fe6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly, I have a pretty hard time reviewing this game because it barely feels like its own thing. It is basically Sniper Elite 5 copy-pasted with new maps, cutscenes, characters, and weapons. So if you played Sniper Elite 5 and just want more, this is perfect. But if you are looking for something new or different, you are at the wrong place. And if you have never played a Sniper Elite game before, either this or SE5 would be a great place to start. It really does not matter much which one you choose.\n\nEven if they released another game exactly like this, I would probably buy it again because the formula is simply fun. Still, I cannot help but find it a bit disappointing how little this one changes. Regardless, I am excited for Sniper Elite 6, if that ever happens.", "timestamp_created": 1788713971, "timestamp_updated": 1788714038, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 58, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.827394545078277588", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 26, "count": 2}]}, {"recommendationid": "234630228", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017539388", "personaname": "ICK-eargoggles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017539388/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 28997, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 26401, "last_played": 1789110484, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you like single player, and you like sniper games, I recommend you try this. It's not perfect, but I don't think there are many single player equals.", "timestamp_created": 1788709792, "timestamp_updated": 1788709792, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 31, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.749978303909301758", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "234577158", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987284534", "personaname": "Dead Game Enjoyer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197987284534/", "num_games_owned": 37, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 3176, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 19, "playtime_at_review": 1329, "last_played": 1790550755, "avatar": "6c443eecd87d249bc70a10515a7909c9a0c99a3a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Definitely better than sniper elite 5 considering how bad 5 was. Would not buy at full price wait for a sale. Last mission was ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ like usual.", "timestamp_created": 1788653719, "timestamp_updated": 1788653719, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.43802875280380249", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "234561996", "author": {"steamid": "76561199661080673", "personaname": "ILikeStuff!", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199661080673/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1126, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 359, "playtime_at_review": 84, "last_played": 1791509585, "avat